    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuntwala muchipaŋu chahanzi, njila yatala kukabeta kakuchimunswa. Hakuntwala mwitala datalaŋana nanoku kwambwiluwu, kwatalaŋana nachuma chatuŋiluwu chatala kukabeta kakuchimunswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumbidi yamuwuleli wamunkotweli nkulakaji, kwadiŋi chenzelu chakukabeta kakuchimunswa, mukutoha mwashikili munkotweli makumi atanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku kwatalaŋeni nankotweli makumi ayedi jakundamini kuchipaŋu chamukachi, ninoku kwatalaŋeni nachisesa chamalola chakundamini kuchipaŋu chahanzi, kwadiŋi wuhitilu watalaŋana nawuhitilu wamumusululu wamatala ahewulu wamuchisatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumbidi yamatalowu kwadiŋi muwendelu, mukutoha kwawu munkotweli ikumi watala mukachi, njila yamunkotweli yimu. Yenzelu yawu yatala kukabeta kakuchimunswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matala ahewulu adiŋi amehi, muloŋa mawuhitilu atepulwiluku kubadika chatepulwiluwu kumatala amwishina, niahakachi kuchumochu chatuŋiluwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa matalowu adiŋi nyisululu yisatu yadilunjika, hiyadiŋi nayishimi neyi yishimi yamuyiŋaŋuku; dichi chiwakeheleli musululu wahewulu chakubadika wamwishina niwahakachi kufumisha heseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbaŋu yahanzi yamumbavu yamatalowu yatala kuchipaŋu chahanzi kumesu amatalowu, kuleha kwayu nkotweli makumi atanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa kuleha kwamatala adiŋi muchipaŋu chahanzi, kwashikili munkotweli makumi atanu. Hakwila kumesu atembeli kwadiŋi nkotweli nkulakaji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwishina damatalowu mwadiŋi wiŋililu kumutamba wakumusela, wakwila neyi muntu wukukeŋa kufuma kuchipaŋu chahanzi hakwijila mu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundama yambaŋu yachipaŋu chatala kumusela, kumesu anoku kwambwiluwu, kumesu achuma chatuŋiluwu, mwadiŋi matala nanjila yadiŋi kumbidi yawu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amwekeni neyi owu matala akukabeta kakuchimunswa; kuleha kwawu kwokumu, nikutoha kwawu kwokumu nawa, nimuwidikilu wawu nimuwuloŋeshelu wawu, nimwaya yenzelu yawu, mwejima mwomumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaya yenzelu yamatala atala kukabeta kakuchidiilu, mwadiŋi nawa chenzelu kwakumina njila, yoyi njila yatala chikupu hambaŋu yatala kumusela, yakwila neyi muntu wukukeŋa kwijila mu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuŋila nindi, Matala akukabeta kakuchimunswa nimatala akukabeta kakuchidiilu, atalaŋana nanoku kwambwiluwu, diwu matala ajila kwakadiilaŋawu yuma yasweja kujila kudi atupristu akundama kwakwihi naYehova. Diku kwakashaŋawu yuma yasweja kujila, ninyilambu yawuŋa, ninyilambu yahanshidi, ninyilambu yakutanya, muloŋa kwenoku kwajila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakeŋilaŋawu atupristu mwenomu, hiyakedikamu nawa cheŋi mwajila aya muchiŋaŋu chahanzi, chakadi kushiya mahinawu akalakalaŋawu nachu mwenomuku; muloŋa mahinowu ajila; akavwalaŋa mahina acheŋi kulonda akakundamaŋa kuyuma yawantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanakumishiyi kweseka itala damukachi hakuŋidishila kunjila yakuchisu chatala kumusela, hakucheseka kwi-ndo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakweseka kumutamba wakumusela neteti dakweseka nachu, mated makulakaji atanu, akweseka neteti dakweseka nachu kwi-ndo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakweseka kumutamba wakukabeta kakuchimunswa, mateti makulakaji atanu, akweseka neteti dakweseka nachu kwi-ndo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakweseka kumutamba wakabeta kakuchidiilu, mateti makulakaji atanu, akweseka neteti dakweseka nachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakubalumukila kumutamba wakumujika, hakweseka mateti makulakaji atanu neteti dakweseka nachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wesekeli kunyitamba yonsu yiwana. Kwadiŋi mbaŋu kwi-ndo, kuleha makulakaji atanu, kutoha nawa makulakaji atanu, kulonda kwambula nachu yajila nayabula kujila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
